    "title": "Don't give up the light: An allegory - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Olson ,\n5 hours ago A long time ago, the people of Sandpoint lived in darkness. When the cold winter months set in, Sandpointians were left to navigate to and from work on streets without lamps, homes without porch lights, and no twinkle lights to cheer their paths. The darkness sunk deep into peoples’ souls.... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
